  "description": "After quitting his job just to end up scammed out of all his money, Yim Sang-Tae's at the end of his rope! He hangs around a luxurious apartment building and throws himself at the first rich person he sees, begging for a meal. But his savior, Mo Yeon-Woo, asks how Sang-Tae will pay him back. When Sang-Tae states he'll use his body, intending to do manual labor, Yeon-Woo agrees and they wind up in bed together! Will Sang-Tae and Yeon-Woo find happiness in their sudden encounter, or will Sang-Tae's debts catch up to him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
